#: rc.cpp:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "&CDDA Settings"
msgstr "&CDDA postavke"

#: rc.cpp:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "CD Device"
msgstr "CD uređaj"

#: rc.cpp:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "De&termine device automatically"
msgstr "&Odredi uređaj automatski"

#: rc.cpp:8
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Uncheck this if you want to specify a CD device different from the one "
"autoprobed"
msgstr ""
"Isključite ovo ako želite izabrati drugi CD uređaj od onog izabranog "
"automatski."

#: rc.cpp:10
#, no-c-format
msgid "De&vice:"
msgstr "U&ređaj:"

#: rc.cpp:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "/dev/cdrom"
msgstr "/dev/cdrom"

#: rc.cpp:14
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specify a location for the drive you want to use. Normally, this is a file "
"inside the /dev folder representing your CD or DVD drive."
msgstr ""
"Odredite lokaciju uređaja kojeg želite koristiti. Obično ovo je datoteka "
"unutar direktorija /dev koja predstavlja vaš CD ili DVD uređaj."

#: rc.cpp:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "Error Correction Settings"
msgstr "Podešavanje ispravki greški"

#: rc.cpp:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable &error correction"
msgstr "Uključi i&spravku greški"

#: rc.cpp:20
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you check this option, the slave will not try to use error correction "
"which can be useful for reading damaged CDs. However, this feature can be "
"problematic in some cases, so you can switch it off here."
msgstr ""
"Ako uključite ovu opciju, slave neće pokušavati koristiti ispravku "
"grešaka. Ova mogućnost može biti korisna kada čitate oštećene CDove, "
"ali zna doći do problema u nekim slučajevima, tako da je ovdje "
"možete isključiti."

#: rc.cpp:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Skip on errors"
msgstr "&Preskoči prilikom greške"

#: rc.cpp:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "File Names"
msgstr "Imena datoteka"

#: rc.cpp:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "File Name Settings"
msgstr "Postavke imena datoteke"

#: rc.cpp:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please enter the filename without an extension that should be used.\n"
"\n"
"The following macros will be expanded:\n"
"\n"
"%{title}  \t\tTrack Title\n"
"%{number}\tTrack Number\n"
"%{year}\t\tYear\n"
"%{genre}\tGenre\n"
"%{albumtitle}\tAlbum Title\n"
"%{albumartist}\tAlbum Artist"
msgstr ""
"Molim unesite ime datoteke bez ekstenzije koje želite da bude korišteno.\n"
"\n"
"Biće korištene sljedeće makro-oznake:\n"
"\n"
"%{title}  \t\tNaziv pjesme\n"
"%{number}\tRedni broj pjesme\n"
"%{year}\t\tGodina\n"
"%{genre}\tŽanr\n"
"%{albumtitle}\tNaziv albuma\n"
"%{albumartist}\tIzvođač"

